sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant FastAPI
    participant LiveKit
    participant Transport
    participant NATS
    participant STT
    participant Brain
    participant Voice
    participant SoVITS

    Browser->>FastAPI: GET /token
    FastAPI-->>Browser: LiveKit JWT and URL
    Browser->>LiveKit: connect and publish mic
    Transport->>LiveKit: join room and subscribe audio
    Transport->>NATS: publish audio.inbound raw PCM
    STT->>NATS: publish audio.perception partials
    STT->>NATS: publish chat.input final
    Brain->>NATS: publish confirmed audio.stop for new user turn
    Brain->>Brain: perception -> appraisal -> state -> decision -> action
    Brain->>NATS: publish chat.output chunks
    Voice->>SoVITS: stream TTS request
    Voice->>NATS: publish audio.stream raw PCM
    Transport->>LiveKit: capture AudioFrame to AI track
    LiveKit-->>Browser: remote audio playback
